--- !u!114 &339023389
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 339023387}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9d7ea898f0605b46b3aa06c5dd60dfb1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HollowCurrent.Interactable
  Kind: 1
  Label: Steward's last entry
  Body: 'BLOOD LEDGER, LAST PAGE IN THE STEWARD''S HAND


    I have hidden the three
    of them where he will not look, because he does not look up or down, only across.
    The blade I put under the stone where the dead sleep. The hilt I gave to the
    stars; they have kept a socket empty for it. The stone I hid behind a face that
    he never could abide.


    If you read this and still have your own blood, find
    the altar.'
  HidePoint: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  ExitPoint: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  Door: {fileID: 0}
  Circuit: {fileID: 0}
  RelicIndex: -1
